window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The final installment in the Fallen Angel trilogy concludes the epic tale of heaven versus hell and the consequences of forbidden love.</p> <p>She was forbidden, and I gave everything to be with her. My grace. My wings. My place in heaven. But still, she was taken from me. Now, thousands of years later, I’ve found her in another life, but she doesn’t know me, and her heart belongs to another.</p> <p>The other Watchers are getting bolder. Soon war will be here. With every fight, I grow closer to heaven but farther from my Selah. I can’t lose her again, not when she’s finally within my grasp. I’ll make her see, help her remember us. She is mine. I won’t let her go. I can’t.</p>"; 
